WEBVTT

NOTE Machine translated from English captions; target=zu.

1
00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:09.630
Le vidiyo inikeza isingeniso esifushane kudivayisi ye-Arclight.

2
00:00:09.630 --> 00:00:15.207
Uma ixhunywe emgodini oseceleni we-ophthalmoscope eqondile izobekwa ngqo

3
00:00:15.207 --> 00:00:20.785
phakathi nendawo yelensi esetshenziswa ikhamera yakho yeselula kuvidiyo

4
00:00:20.785 --> 00:00:26.362
imodi.

5
00:00:26.362 --> 00:00:30.978
Ikhamera izosebenza njengamehlo akho.

6
00:00:30.978 --> 00:00:38.479
Uma ubheka ngembobo eseceleni, ukuze uqinisekise ukuthi iyiphi ilensi eya kuyo

7
00:00:38.479 --> 00:00:45.980
faka imbobo eseceleni ngokuthi, vula ividiyo ocingweni lwakho.

8
00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:49.460
Beka umunwe wakho phezu kwelensi ngayinye ngokulandelana.

9
00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:55.380
Uma isikrini siba mnyama, uvale ilensi esetshenziselwa ividiyo.

10
00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:59.460
Susa iphepha eliphuzi ngemuva kwesiqeshana.

11
00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:06.700
Beka amaphoyinti omcibisholo phakathi nendawo yelensi esetshenziselwa ukuthwebula ividiyo.

12
00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:09.420
Cindezela isiqeshana phansi ngokuqinile.

13
00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:11.320
Susa umcibisholo.

14
00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:14.780
Isiqeshana kufanele manje sibe sesimweni esifanele.

15
00:01:14.780 --> 00:01:20.018
Ukuze wenze ividiyo ukushintsha kwe-reflex kumqondisi we-Talmosco, ukuphela kwesenzo

16
00:01:20.018 --> 00:01:21.140
izibani bese ukhetha

17
00:01:21.140 --> 00:01:24.300
ukukhanya okugqamile ngokuchofoza kathathu.

18
00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:27.500
Qinisekisa ukuthi i-lens rack iphezulu.

19
00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:33.020
Lapho ukukhanya kubheke kude nefoni kuya esigulini, beka ukukhanya kwesenzo phakathi

20
00:01:33.020 --> 00:01:37.460
isiqeshana bese udonsa ukunwebeka ukuze uvikeleke.

21
00:01:37.460 --> 00:01:42.220
Phusha isenzo sikhanyisa kuze kube yilapho singasakwazi ukuslayida ngokuqhubekayo.

22
00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:47.167
Imbobo yesilayidi yomqondisi we-oscilloscope manje izophela ngokuqondile

23
00:01:47.167 --> 00:01:48.580
isikhungo se

24
00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:51.020
ilensi yokuthwebula ividiyo.

25
00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:56.100
Ukuze urekhode iso langaphandle, sebenzisa esinye isiphetho sedivayisi.

26
00:01:56.100 --> 00:02:02.458
Ukuze uthwebule isithombe manje, vula ividiyo phezulu futhi usondeze ugcwalise isikrini

27
00:02:02.458 --> 00:02:03.820
ngombono

28
00:02:03.820 --> 00:02:05.660
ngembobo eseceleni.

29
00:02:05.660 --> 00:02:08.700
Cindezela irekhodi bese wenza ukuhlola.

30
00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:10.740
Cindezela okuthi misa bese ulondoloza ividiyo.

31
00:02:10.740 --> 00:02:18.220
Manje usungabelana nozakwenu ezinkundleni ezibethelwe ze-SQR kuphela ngenjongo oyizuzile

32
00:02:18.220 --> 00:02:26.590
iqoqwe ezigulini.

33
00:02:26.590 --> 00:02:43.330
Jabulela ukusebenzisa izibani zesenzo emsebenzini wami.
